在适用法律允许范围内，受限材料按现状和可用状态提供，不保证适销性、特定用途适用性、正确性、最优性、连续可用或不侵权。使用者负责独立核验，不将未经验证结果用于生产或安全关键决策。在法律允许范围内，许可人不对使用或不能使用所致直接、间接、附带、特殊或后果性损失负责，包括数据、利润或业务损失；法律禁止排除的责任保留。
To the extent permitted by applicable law, Restricted Materials are provided as-is and as-available without warranties of merchantability, fitness, correctness, optimality, availability or noninfringement. Recipients must independently validate results and not use unvalidated output for production or safety-critical decisions. To the extent permitted by law, the licensor is not liable for direct, indirect, incidental, special or consequential loss from use or inability to use, including lost data, profits or business. Non-excludable liability is preserved.

