本许可不单独授予商标、官方身份或明确专利许可；依法或依其他有效授权取得的权利保留。不选定排他法院，不推定许可人国籍或住所；法律与管辖按相关强制规则确定，另有有效书面约定除外。中英文意在表达同一范围，不因较宽译文自动扩大许可；实质歧义应书面澄清并服从强制解释规则。个别无效不影响其余可独立实施条款。
No separate trademark, official-identity or express patent license is granted; rights arising by law or other valid grants remain preserved. No exclusive forum, nationality or residence is assumed; applicable law and jurisdiction follow relevant mandatory rules unless separately and validly agreed. Chinese/English intend the same scope, without automatic expansion through a broader translation; material ambiguity should be clarified in writing subject to mandatory interpretation rules. Invalidity of one term leaves independently enforceable terms intact.

