API access follows docs/API-TERMS.md and a separate account/request grant; this license issues no key. New terms apply only to later material or new grants expressly adopting them, not retroactively through website edits. Special grants identify version, account/request, purpose and amended clauses. Unexpressed rights in Restricted Materials are reserved.

